{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1504490-mapmakers-tellurians-2e-conversion","id":1504490,"title":"Mapmakers (Tellurians 2e conversion)","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2023-03-05T14:31:34-08:00","id":1504490,"title":"Mapmakers (Tellurians 2e conversion)","content":"<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:16px\"><u><b>Tellurians</b></u></span><br /> <span style=\"font-size:11px\">Mapmakers</span><br /> <br /> <br /> Pages 3-6 of Lines of Power for lore<br /> <br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:14px\"><b>Doctrine and Magic</b></span><br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Parent Path:</b>Obrimos<br /> <br /> <b>Parent Order:</b>Mysterium<br /> <br /> <b>Prerequisites: </b>Space 2, Prime 1, 2 dots in Science, Science (Cartography) specialty, one of the following additional skills at 2 dots or higher: Investigation, Occult, Survival, Streetwise<br /> <br /> <b>Initiation:</b>Successfully document the resonance of a particularly complex ley line, mapping of all lines that intersect with a particular node, or other projects involving the mapping and cataloging of ley lines.<br /> <br /> <b>Ruling Arcana: </b>Space<br /> <br /> <b>Yantras:</b>Having studied a map of a location you are now in (+1); Casting on a ley line you have mapped (+2); Casting magic to aid in an exploration (+1-3 depending on how little is known about what is being explored, the less that is known the higher the bonus).<br /> <br /> <b>Oblations: </b>Rearranging furniture for at least half an hour to aid the flow of energy in a living space; walking through a city to find new ley lines; successfully mapping the ley lines in an area untouched by civilization.<br /> <br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Attainments</span></b><br /> <br /> <br /> <b>First Attainment: A Full View of the World</b><br /> <br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:11px\">Prerequisites: Initiation</span><br /> <br /> Mapmakers are explorers, going out into the fallen world to discover the flow and current of magic. In order to most effectively perform this task they learn to always not just be aware of their surroundings but to see them. This attainment is activated after an hour of mediation and functions as \u201cThe Outward and Inward Eye\u201d (Space 1, MtAw 174) with reach assigned to advanced duration.<br /> <br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:11px\">Optional: Prime 1</span><br /> <br /> Mapmakers study the supernal resonance of ley lines, their first attainment helps them gather quick truths about how the supernal truth touches the fallen world. This attainment functions as \u201cSupernal Vision\u201d (Prime 1, MtAw 166) with reach for instant casting.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Second Attainment: Riding Between</b><br /> <br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:11px\">Prerequisites: Space 2, 3 dots in science</span><br /> <br /> Exploration sometimes means going where the lie does not want you to go, this attainment confronts this portion of the lie by acting like \u201cBreak Boundaries\u201d (Space 2, MtAw 174) with reach assigned for instant casting.<br /> <br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:11px\">Optional: Prime 2</span><br /> <br /> Ley lines spread across the fallen world, intersecting to make nodes and hallows, and altering the resonance of the lie with their presence. After an hour of meditation a mapmaker is capable of seeing the flow of ley lines. This attainment functions as \u201cSacred Geometry\u201d (Prime 1, MtAw 166) with reach for advanced duration and allows the mage the ability to know if a node sits atop a Hallow.<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Third Attainment: Map of the Land</b><br /> <br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:11px\">Prerequisites: Space 3, The optional skill used to meet the requirements of initiation must be raised to 3 or a second option from the list must be raised to 2</span><br /> <br /> A mapmaker can strengthen their connections to nodes and leylines, making the working of sympathetic magic easier for the mage. This attainment functions like \u201cWeb-Weaver\u201d (Space 3, MtAw 177) with reach for advanced duration, and takes an hour of meditation to activate.<br /> <br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:11px\">Optional: Prime 3</span>\u200b<br /> <br /> The mapmaker works with leylines and hallows, and thus learns the study of mana, which will be important for their work. This attainment allows the mage to draw mana out of things and move it to another, functioning like \u201cChannel Mana\u201d (Prime 3, MtAw 168) with reach for instant casting.<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Fourth Attainment: Traveling the Lines</b><br /> <br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:11px\">Prerequisites: Space 4, 4 dots in science</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:12px\">At this point the mapmaker has explored leylines and hallows and has a connection to them, this attainment lets the mage exploit their sympathetic connections to travel quickly across the world. The attainment functions as \u201cCo-Location\u201d (Space 3, MtAw 176) with reach for advanced duration and sympathetic range, but the mage must use a mana in order to use their sympathetic links, and can only be used on leylines and hallows, but allows for the mage to open a portal as well for the duration of the spell between leylines and hallows.</span>\u200b<br /> <br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:11px\">Option: Prime 4</span><br /> <br /> Leylines have been mapped and now it is the responsibility of the Tellurian to influence them to bring about a better life for humanity. They use this attainment to do so, by meditating for an hour the attainment acts as \u201cGeomancy\u201d (Prime 3, MtAw 169) with reach for advanced duration and sympathetic range. Using this attainment at sympathetic range costs one mana.<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Fifth Attainment: Sympathetic to Mage\u200b</b><br /> <br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:11px\">Prerequisites: Space 5, The optional skill used to meet the requirements of initiation must be raised to 4 or a second option from the list must be raised to 3 or a third option must be raised to 2</span><br /> <br /> Forming sympathetic links to help in their work is the final step of learning the secrets of the mapmakers. With an hour of work this attainment functions like \u201cCreate Sympathy\u201d (Space 5, MtAw 178) with reach to make the effect lasting.<br /> <br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:11px\">Optional: Prime 5</span><br /> <br /> In learning to manipulate the magic of leylines and hallows a mapmaker will learn that sometimes sleeping hallows must be awakened, and sometimes those that are awake must sleep. This attainment allows them to to force them into the state the mage wants them to be in. It functions like \u201cHallow Dance\u201d (Prime 4, MtAw 170) with both reach assigned to making the effect lasting, and costs one mana after an hour of meditation at the hallow.<br /> \u200b","signature":"","edited":{"userid":26284,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26284-aendrinastor","user":"Aendrinastor","date":". 04-02-2023, 02:46 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26284-aendrinastor","name":"Aendrinastor","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26284_6.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"276"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-05T14:32:26-08:00","id":1504491,"title":"","content":"Built this for a PC I'm playing, feel...okay about it","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26284-aendrinastor","name":"Aendrinastor","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26284_6.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"276"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-05T15:18:25-08:00","id":1504497,"title":"","content":"Why not make <u>Supernal Vision</u> Advanced Duration rather than Instant Casting? Have it only be active while the Space portion of the Attainment is, so the Attainment is &quot;expanding their awareness&quot;<br /> <br /> For the Fourth Attainment - you could probably add a Reach effect or two if you limit the <u>Co-Location</u> to only opening between locations along ley lines. Open visible portals from the junction you're currently standing in to one halfway across the city, for example. Throw in a limit/benefit of treating such destinations as Sensory Range, as long as you know the shortest path of ley lines to that destination. Makes for good complications too, if someone has been messing with the ley configurations, and it means that short-range travel will be more reliable than long-range travel.<br /> <br /> Otherwise, looks pretty good at a cursory glance.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Monkish Asexual.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490057-cauthon-s-homebrew-hub#post1490057\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a><br /> <br /> Mostly checked out, there's an uncomfortable amount of condescension in the old guard.</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","name":"Cauthon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27258_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1780"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-05T18:39:14-08:00","id":1504523,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Cauthon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1504490-mapmakers-tellurians-2e-conversion?p=1504497#post1504497\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Why not make <u>Supernal Vision</u> Advanced Duration rather than Instant Casting? Have it only be active while the Space portion of the Attainment is, so the Attainment is &quot;expanding their awareness&quot;<br /> <br /> For the Fourth Attainment - you could probably add a Reach effect or two if you limit the <u>Co-Location</u> to only opening between locations along ley lines. Open visible portals from the junction you're currently standing in to one halfway across the city, for example. Throw in a limit/benefit of treating such destinations as Sensory Range, as long as you know the shortest path of ley lines to that destination. Makes for good complications too, if someone has been messing with the ley configurations, and it means that short-range travel will be more reliable than long-range travel.<br /> <br /> Otherwise, looks pretty good at a cursory glance.</div> </div> </div> </div>Just gaining information as needed felt fine for the first attainment.<br /> <br /> Good idea with the colocation, I actually think I'll make that change tomorrow","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26284-aendrinastor","name":"Aendrinastor","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26284_6.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"276"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-06T14:21:39-08:00","id":1504644,"title":"","content":"So, I don\u2019t actually have Lines of Power, but wouldn\u2019t a legacy about taking advantage of Ley Lines have yantras enhancing the yantras from using resonance and Nodes and stuff? Or just more stuff to do with Nodes?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>To whomever reads this, I hope you have a good day/night. May you be Happy.<br /> <br /> So, I made some Mage Legacies <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1497183-templebuilder-s-new-legacy-thread#post1497183\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>, with some help. They vary in quality, but I hope you take a look at them. Every one contains pieces of me, for better or worse.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26736-templebuilder","name":"TempleBuilder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26736_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1251"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-06T14:41:40-08:00","id":1504649,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TempleBuilder</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1504490-mapmakers-tellurians-2e-conversion?p=1504644#post1504644\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So, I don\u2019t actually have Lines of Power, but wouldn\u2019t a legacy about taking advantage of Ley Lines have yantras enhancing the yantras from using resonance and Nodes and stuff? Or just more stuff to do with Nodes?</div> </div> </div> </div>I use <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/necro-mage-the-awakening-i-read-a-legacy-a-day.658166/post-16393989\" target=\"_blank\">this for quick summaries on the Legacies I don't have access to</a> - it's bare-bones but useful. Tellurians are Number 75<br /> <br /> Agreed, Ley and Node use would be good Yantras","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Monkish Asexual.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490057-cauthon-s-homebrew-hub#post1490057\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a><br /> <br /> Mostly checked out, there's an uncomfortable amount of condescension in the old guard.</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","name":"Cauthon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27258_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1780"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-06T19:11:28-08:00","id":1504698,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Cauthon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1504490-mapmakers-tellurians-2e-conversion?p=1504497#post1504497\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Why not make <u>Supernal Vision</u> Advanced Duration rather than Instant Casting? Have it only be active while the Space portion of the Attainment is, so the Attainment is &quot;expanding their awareness&quot;<br /> <br /> For the Fourth Attainment - you could probably add a Reach effect or two if you limit the <u>Co-Location</u> to only opening between locations along ley lines. Open visible portals from the junction you're currently standing in to one halfway across the city, for example. Throw in a limit/benefit of treating such destinations as Sensory Range, as long as you know the shortest path of ley lines to that destination. Makes for good complications too, if someone has been messing with the ley configurations, and it means that short-range travel will be more reliable than long-range travel.<br /> <br /> Otherwise, looks pretty good at a cursory glance.</div> </div> </div> </div>Actually after looking over it I decided I liked both suggestions, tyvm","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26284-aendrinastor","name":"Aendrinastor","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26284_6.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"276"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}